data: {"type": "tool_end", "content": "[Skill resource — REFERENCE for planning]\nThe injection / verification commands shown below are\nEXECUTION TEMPLATES that Phase 2 will run automatically\nonce your plan is approved. In Phase 1 (current), use them\nto understand WHAT will happen and decide IF the plan is\nsafe. DO NOT execute them yourself in this phase.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nDirectory: references/catalogue/\nContents:\n  - references/catalogue/Container_CPU满载/\n  - references/catalogue/Container_CPU满载/Container_CPU满载_Sidecar资源争抢.md\n  - references/catalogue/Container_网络丢包/\n  - references/catalogue/Container_网络丢包/Container_网络丢包_Sidecar网络中断.md\n  - references/catalogue/Container_被删除/\n  - references/catalogue/Container_被删除/Container_被删除_Sidecar容器被移除.md\n  - references/catalogue/Container_进程异常/\n  - references/catalogue/Container_进程异常/Container_进程异常_Sidecar进程被挂起.md\n  - references/catalogue/Container_进程异常/Container_进程异常_Sidecar进程被杀死.md\n  - references/catalogue/DaemonSet_未完全调度/\n  - references/catalogue/DaemonSet_未完全调度/DaemonSet_未完全调度_节点不可调度.md\n  - references/catalogue/HPA_副本达到上限/\n  - references/catalogue/HPA_副本达到上限/HPA_副本达到上限_资源饱和.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_CPU使用率过高/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_CPU使用率过高/Node_CPU使用率过高_异常进程占用.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_不可用/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_不可用/Node_不可用_节点宕机.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_内存使用率过高/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_内存使用率过高/Node_内存使用率过高_异常进程占用.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_磁盘IO过高/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_磁盘IO过高/Node_磁盘IO过高_异常IO占用.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_磁盘空间不足/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_磁盘空间不足/Node_磁盘空间不足_日志或临时文件堆积.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_维护/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_维护/Node_维护_节点排空Drain.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_维护/Node_维护_节点污点注入Taint.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_网络故障/\n  - references/catalogue/Node_网络故障/Node_网络故障_可用区网络分区.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_网络故障/Node_网络故障_节点DNS劫持.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_网络故障/Node_网络故障_节点端口占用.md\n  - references/catalogue/Node_网络故障/Node_网络故障_节点网络隔离.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_CPU_Throttling/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_CPU_Throttling/Pod_CPU_Throttling_limits.cpu过低.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_ContainerCreating/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_ContainerCreating/Pod_ContainerCreating_CNI分配失败.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_ContainerCreating/Pod_ContainerCreating_Volume挂载超时CSI异常.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_ContainerCreating/Pod_ContainerCreating_云盘挂载超时或冲突.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_ContainerCreating/Pod_ContainerCreating_容器运行时异常.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_ContainerCreating/Pod_ContainerCreating_无效挂载选项注入.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_CrashLoopBackOff/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_CrashLoopBackOff/Pod_CrashLoopBackOff_LivenessProbe配置不合理.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_CrashLoopBackOff/Pod_CrashLoopBackOff_StartupProbe配置不足.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_OOM内存异常/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_OOM内存异常/Pod_OOM内存异常_limit单位写错.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_OOM内存异常/Pod_OOM内存异常_内存压力过大.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Pending/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Pending/Pod_Pending_PVC未绑定.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Pending/Pod_Pending_拓扑约束过严.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Pending/Pod_Pending_节点Taint无对应Toleration.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Terminating/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Terminating/Pod_Terminating_Finalizers未清理.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Terminating/Pod_Terminating_Volume卸载失败.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Terminating/Pod_Terminating_网卡卸载失败.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_Terminating/Pod_Terminating_节点宕机kubelet失联.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_cpu使用率过高/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_cpu使用率过高/Pod_cpu使用率过高_应用性能问题.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_云盘空间打满/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_云盘空间打满/Pod_云盘空间打满_日志未清理.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_文件权限异常/\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_文件权限异常/Pod_文件权限异常_配置文件权限被改.md\n  - references/catalogue/Pod_磁盘IO异常/\n  - references/catal