data: {"type": "confirm", "content": "Fault type: pod-cpu-load\nScope: pod\nTarget: cpu\nAction: load\nNamespace: otel-demo\nDuration: 600s\nTarget resources: cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w\nParameters: cpu-count=1, cpu-percent=80\nUser description: 针对 otel-demo 的 cart 服务注入 80% CPU 负载，最长持续 300 秒，并验证故障效果和业务恢复。用户选定方案 A：--cpu-percent 80 --cpu-count 1，范围仅限 otel-demo 下 cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w 这一个 Pod，到期自动清理；若平台最小时长为 600 秒，则在确认故障效果后立即销毁，不等自动到期。（本次为首次提交未落地后的原规格重发）", "node": "intent_confirm", "task_id": "turn-26465c0e8a18", "payload": {"type": "intent_confirm", "fault_intent": {"fault_type": "pod-cpu-load", "scope": "pod", "target": "cpu", "action": "load", "namespace": "otel-demo", "names": ["cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w"], "labels": {}, "params": {"cpu-count": "1", "cpu-percent": "80"}, "params_flags": [], "duration_seconds": 600, "user_description": "针对 otel-demo 的 cart 服务注入 80% CPU 负载，最长持续 300 秒，并验证故障效果和业务恢复。用户选定方案 A：--cpu-percent 80 --cpu-count 1，范围仅限 otel-demo 下 cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w 这一个 Pod，到期自动清理；若平台最小时长为 600 秒，则在确认故障效果后立即销毁，不等自动到期。（本次为首次提交未落地后的原规格重发）", "case_resource_path": "references/catalogue/Pod_cpu使用率过高/Pod_cpu使用率过高_应用性能问题.md", "revision": 1, "objective": "", "boundaries": [], "constraints": [], "assumptions": []}, "summary": "Fault type: pod-cpu-load\nScope: pod\nTarget: cpu\nAction: load\nNamespace: otel-demo\nDuration: 600s\nTarget resources: cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w\nParameters: cpu-count=1, cpu-percent=80\nUser description: 针对 otel-demo 的 cart 服务注入 80% CPU 负载，最长持续 300 秒，并验证故障效果和业务恢复。用户选定方案 A：--cpu-percent 80 --cpu-count 1，范围仅限 otel-demo 下 cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w 这一个 Pod，到期自动清理；若平台最小时长为 600 秒，则在确认故障效果后立即销毁，不等自动到期。（本次为首次提交未落地后的原规格重发）", "intent_confidence": 1.0, "intent_reasoning": "submit_fault_intent tool executed", "clarification_round": 1, "batch_faults": null, "fault_revision": 1}, "timestamp": "2026-09-11T16:42:10.097065+08:00"}

