   <none>           <none>\notel-collector-65f9b55797-2d8km    1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.217   tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\npayment-7b6cb66f87-p9pw5           1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.141   tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\npostgresql-855ccdc85b-d4nh7        1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.81    tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\nproduct-catalog-68d55776cd-jx6ss   1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.104   tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\nproduct-reviews-547fc7788-nw64q    1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.139   tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\nquote-9bc787749-sp9gb              1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.44    tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\nrecommendation-5c9c77664c-sgmr8    1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.148   tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\nshipping-6bc46c8dd4-lmncg          1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.1     tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\nvalkey-cart-848b7d7cff-4ktj4       1/1     Running   0                 2d10h   10.0.1.191   tcse-v100-02   <none>           <none>\n", "node": "phase1_tools", "tool_name": "kubectl_read", "task_id": "turn-e708412252a4", "call_id": "01a08fa4-c974-7982-bc3c-f034adc35d70", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T16:45:36.588539+08:00"}

