data: {"type": "result", "content": "{\"status\": \"success\", \"data\": {\"task_id\": \"inject-d0fc193f-ff92-4e66-bd25-2cc29bae3359\", \"task_state\": \"injected\", \"fault_type\": \"pod-cpu-load\", \"experiment_uid\": \"c85164b57ff93a3a\", \"injection_method\": \"host_blade\", \"fault_handle\": {\"kind\": \"experiment_uid\", \"value\": \"c85164b57ff93a3a\", \"method\": \"host_blade\"}, \"recovery_handle\": {\"kind\": \"experiment_uid\", \"value\": \"c85164b57ff93a3a\", \"experiment_uid\": \"c85164b57ff93a3a\"}, \"duration_ms\": 2096824, \"fault_spec\": {\"namespace\": \"otel-demo\", \"scope\": \"pod\", \"names\": [\"cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w\"], \"labels\": {}, \"fault_target\": \"cpu\", \"fault_action\": \"load\", \"params\": {\"cpu-count\": \"1\", \"cpu-percent\": \"80\"}, \"params_flags\": [], \"duration_seconds\": 600, \"source\": \"tui\", \"user_description\": \"针对 otel-demo 的 cart 服务注入 80% CPU 负载，最长持续 300 秒，并验证故障效果和业务恢复。用户选定方案 A：--cpu-percent 80 --cpu-count 1，范围仅限 otel-demo 下 cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w 这一个 Pod，到期自动清理；若平台最小时长为 600 秒，则如实告知并在确认故障效果后立即销毁，不等自动到期。（第三次提交，规格不变；前两次因用户侧确认环节未落地，重发前已核对无活跃实验、cart 处于 5m 基线，无叠加风险）\", \"case_resource_path\": \"references/catalogue/Pod_cpu使用率过高/Pod_cpu使用率过高_应用性能问题.md\", \"revision\": 1, \"objective\": \"\", \"boundaries\": [], \"constraints\": [], \"assumptions\": []}, \"target\": {\"namespace\": \"otel-demo\", \"names\": [\"cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w\"], \"labels\": {}, \"resource_type\": \"pod\"}, \"params\": {\"cpu-count\": \"1\", \"cpu-percent\": \"80\"}, \"execution_artifacts\": [], \"verification\": {\"level\": \"verified\", \"layer1\": {\"status\": \"warning\", \"details\": \"Experiment record is 'Destroyed' before its --timeout elapsed — the record was destroyed externally (e.g. post-injection cleanup), not by timeout expiry. Record liveness cannot judge the fault's actual effects; Layer 2 will verify cluster-level evidence.\", \"raw_output\": \"{\\\"code\\\":200,\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"Uid\\\":\\\"c85164b57ff93a3a\\\",\\\"Command\\\":\\\"k8s\\\",\\\"SubCommand\\\":\\\"pod-cpu fullload\\\",\\\"Flag\\\":\\\" --cpu-count=1 --timeout=600 --cpu-percent=80 --names=cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w --kubeconfig=/root/bladeai-eval/kubeconfig-bladeai --namespace=otel-demo\\\",\\\"Status\\\":\\\"Destroyed\\\",\\\"Error\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"CreateTime\\\":\\\"2026-09-11T17:03:53.470847848+08:00\\\",\\\"UpdateTime\\\":\\\"2026-09-11T17:06:40.965545905+08:00\\\"}}\\n\", \"resource_statuses\": [], \"affected_count\": 0, \"expired\": true}, \"layer2\": {\"status\": \"passed\", \"details\": \"cart container cgroup cpu.stat usage_usec rate rose from 4m baseline (0.004 core) to 0.783-0.807 core (~780m, +779m) sustained across the 167s active window, caused by chaos_os PID 4631 running `cpu fullload --cpu-count=1 --cpu-percent=80` inside the target container; 1/1 target coverage; fully recovered post-destroy (2m, zero residual processes, zero CRs).\"}, \"warnings\": [\"SHORT ACTIVE WINDOW BY DESIGN (not a verification gap): the platform enforces a minimum --timeout of 600s, which exceeds the user's 300s cap, so destroy was issued immediately after effect confirmation per the user's explicit pre-authorization. Active window was ~167s (create 2026-09-11T09:03:53Z -> destroy 09:06:40Z), well inside the 300s limit. Consequently the fault had ALREADY fully recovered when this verification phase sampled: current CPU is 2m (kubectl top) / 0.0071 core (cgroup delta) vs 4m baseline, with no burn process. Layer 2 is scored 'passed' rather than 'recovered_before_observation' per the transient-fault rule, because observations taken during the active window showed a clear, large, mechanism-attributed change from baseline (+779m) -- 'recovered_before_observation' is reserved for cases where NO observation at ANY point showed fault effects.\", \"RECOVERY-FAILURE MODE ENCOUNTERED AND RESOLVED: `blade destroy` returned Success and `blade_status` reported Status=Destroyed while a chaos_os process (PID 4669, operator-internal uid cdb57e836d2eced5) was still burning 0.807 core. Teardown proved ASYNCHRONOUS -- the destroy CR a6b53a74dbce5724 (phase Running) subsequently completed and was garbage-collected, and the process cleared. The documented manual-cleanup fallback (kill of chaos* processes, PID 1 explicitly excluded) was issued as belt-and-braces; PID 1 ./cart verified unharmed. FINAL STATE VERIFIED CLEAN: zero residual chaos/burn/stress processes in the container, zero chaosblades.chaosblade.io CRs cluster-wide, cart 1/1 Running RESTARTS=0 AGE 2d10h.\", \"PLANNER V3 (PSI) WAS AN INCORRECT PREDICTION FOR THIS ENVIRONMENT -- do not reuse: cpu.pressure remained some/full avg10=avg60=avg300=0.00 throughout the fault (total moved only 357123583 -> 357233711). Reason: the cart container cgroup has cpu.max = 'max 100000' (NO CPU limit) and nr_throttled=0 / throttled_usec=0, so a 0.8-core busy-loop creates no runqueue contention and PSI legitimately stays at zero. PSI is NOT a valid CPU-load signal for unlimited cgroups; cpu.stat usage_usec deltas are. The V3 negative is therefore 'expected', not evidence of injection failure.\", \"PRE-TASK PROBE CONTRADICTED BY RUNTIME: the environment hint declared metrics-server unavailable ('kubectl top will fail'), but `kubectl top pod cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w -n otel-demo --containers` executed successfully at both baseline (4m) and post-recovery (2m). Runtime observation trusted over the hint, per instructions.\", \"BASELINE INTEGRITY CORRECTION: the pre-injection baseline recorded in the execution ledger used cpu.pressure (0.00), which is insensitive in this environment and therefore not a usable reference. The authoritative baselines used for all comparisons here are (a) `kubectl top` cart container = 4m CPU / 59Mi and (b) cgroup usage_usec rate ~0.004-0.007 core. Resource identity held constant across every comparison: the cart container cgroup of pod cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w on node tcse-v100-02, which never restarted (RESTARTS=0, AGE 2d10h), so usage_usec is cumulative and directly comparable.\", \"UNRELATED PRE-EXISTING INSTABILITY flagged for the user (not caused by this fault): accounting-855dcc699b-l5g6h in otel-demo is in a chronic OOMKilled crashloop -- RESTARTS=190, last termination reason OOMKilled exitCode=137 at 2026-09-11T09:00:43Z, which precedes injection start (09:03:53Z) by 3min10s. Its memory limit likely needs raising; this is independent of the cart CPU experiment.\", \"COVERAGE: the approved target set was exactly ONE pod (otel-demo/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w) and coverage is 1/1. `blade query k8s` matched exactly one identifier (otel-demo/tcse-v100-02/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w/cart/cc50d9f8d286/docker) -- no under-coverage and no collateral. --names (not --labels) was used, so no other cart replica was touched.\"], \"overall\": \"verified\", \"primary_evidence_observed\": true, \"baseline_used\": true, \"checklist\": {\"items\": [{\"step\": 1, \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"CPU sustained far above threshold on the SAME resource (cart container cgroup, pod cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w, RESTARTS=0 so counters continuous). BASELINE: `kubectl top pod cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w -n otel-demo --containers` = 4m CPU / 59Mi (pre-injection collector, 17:03:46+08:00); cgroup rate ~0.004 core. DURING FAULT: cpu.stat usage_usec delta = 7,834,970 usec / 10s = 0.783 core (783m); two further independent windows gave 6,310,953 usec/8s = 0.789 core and 6,452,924 usec/8s = 0.807 core. Delta = baseline 4m -> ~783m (+779m, ~19,400% increase), i.e. 97-101% of the declared 800m target -- converged AT target, not a sub-target plateau. POST-RECOVERY (this phase): usage_usec 16430513982 -> 16430620629 = 106,647 usec / 15s = 0.0071 core, and `kubectl top` = 2m -- back to baseline, confirming the +779m was fault-attributable and not ambient load. (deviation: during-fault magnitude measured via cgroup cpu.stat deltas rather than live `kubectl top` polling, because the pre-task probe declared metrics-server unavailable; cpu.stat usage_usec is a strictly more precise measure of the identical quantity on the identical cgroup. `kubectl top` was subsequently confirmed WORKING at runtime and used for the baseline and post-recovery endpoints, so the skill case's specified method was in fact satisfied at both ends.)\"}, {\"step\": 2, \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Entered the target container and identified the CPU-consuming process, establishing MECHANISM ATTRIBUTION rather than inferring from injection success. /proc scan inside cart container during the fault found chaos_os PID 4631. Full cmdline of the burn process: `/opt/chaosblade/bin/chaos_os create cpu fullload --cgroup-root=/host-sys/fs/cgroup/ --cpu-count=1 --cpu-percent=80 --uid=cdb57e836d2eced5 --channel=nsexec --ns_target=905448 --ns_pid=true --ns_mnt=true` -- the top CPU consumer IS the ChaosBlade burn process carrying exactly the declared parameters (cpu-count=1, cpu-percent=80), running inside the target's PID/mnt namespaces (ns_target=905448). Attribution cross-checked by process start time: /proc/4669/stat field 22 = 2159402381 ticks / CLK_TCK 100 vs /proc/uptime = 21594116.41s -> process started 92.6s before observation, i.e. INSIDE the injection window (create 2026-09-11T09:03:53Z -> destroy 09:06:40Z), ruling out a pre-existing orphan. Container PID 1 confirmed to be `./cart` throughout (never disturbed). POST-RECOVERY: `ps -o pid,args` shows only PID 1 ./cart -- burn process gone. (deviation: planner's `ps -eo pid,pcpu,args --sort=-pcpu` is unsupported in this image -- `-e`/`pcpu`/`--sort` caused silent fallback to /proc/loadavg; substituted `ps -o pid,args` plus direct /proc/[0-9]*/comm and /proc/<pid>/stat enumeration, which additionally yielded per-process start time used for attribution.)\"}, {\"step\": 3, \"status\": \"not_applicable\", \"evidence\": \"No APM backend with a queryable CPU-hotspot view is deployed/reachable in this cluster. otel-collector-65f9b55797-2d8km exists only as a telemetry pipeline; no APM UI/query entry point is exposed to the bound read-only tools, and metrics-server-independent trace querying is unavailable. The skill case marks this step optional and states explicitly that its absence does not affect the verdict (\\\"无 APM 不影响判定\\\"). No target fabricated. Verdict rests on Steps 1-2, both passed.\"}, {\"step\": 4, \"status\": \"not_applicable\", \"evidence\": \"Step precondition unmet: no application access entry point was provided for the exercise, so cross-service latency/timeout could not be driven. Skill case states \\\"无入口时上述 CPU 级证据成立即可判定\\\" -- CPU-level evidence (Steps 1-2) suffices. Supporting observation recorded faithfully (absence included, no extra sampling performed): `kubectl logs cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w -n otel-demo --tail=25` shows continuous healthy info-level GetCartAsync/AddItemAsync calls (userId=de3655fc-adc0-11f1-a2c0-0232effe8d14) with NO error/warn/timeout accumulation; pod stayed 1/1 Running with RESTARTS=0. This absence of propagated business impact is the ANTICIPATED outcome, not injection failure: cart has no liveness/readiness probes (so it cannot be marked NotReady or restarted), and the burn consumed 0.8 of node tcse-v100-02's 8 allocatable cores (10%), leaving the node unsaturated -- node conditions Ready=True, MemoryPressure=False, DiskPressure=False, PIDPressure=False, NetworkUnavailable=False. Blast radius contained: all 23 pods on tcse-v100-02 are 1/1 Running; the only restart anomaly, accounting-855dcc699b-l5g6h (RESTARTS=190), last terminated OOMKilled exitCode=137 at 2026-09-11T09:00:43Z -- 3min10s BEFORE injection start, therefore chronologically not attributable to this fault (chronic pre-existing OOM loop, ~1 restart per 18min over 2d10h).\"}], \"skipped_count\": 0, \"non_passed_count\": 0, \"total_count\": 4, \"total_executed\": 4}, \"evidence_coverage\": {\"profile_id\": \"k8s:pod:cpu\", \"required\": [\"target_identity\", \"primary_metric\", \"independent_cross_metric\"], \"covered\": [\"target_identity\", \"primary_metric\", \"independent_cross_metric\"], \"missing\": [], \"complete\": true}, \"baseline_confidence\": \"high\"}, \"side_effects\": {\"container_restarts\": [{\"pod\": \"accounting-855dcc699b-l5g6h\", \"namespace\": \"otel-demo\", \"container\": \"accounting\", \"restart_delta\": 1, \"restart_count\": 191, \"reason\": \"OOMKilled\", \"finished_at\": \"2026-09-11T09:14:45Z\"}]}, \"blast_radius_detail\": \"故障效果仅作用于 otel-demo/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w 单个 Pod 的 cgroup（0.8 core CPU 消耗），用 --names 精确锁定、不使用标签选择器，不波及其它 cart 副本或同命名空间 Pod。两点如实披露：(1) 会新增一个 cluster-scoped chaosblades.chaosblade.io CR 作为实验记录（控制面对象，不改变任何现有工作负载行为，销毁后自动清理）；(2) otel-demo 全部 23 个 Pod 共置于节点 tcse-v100-02（CPU limits 已超卖 146%），新增 0.8 core ≈ 节点 8 核的 10%，对共置 Pod（尤其 valkey-cart）存在低概率 CPU 挤占，已纳入中止条件实时监控。cart 无探针、无 CPU limit、replicas=1，注入不会触发重启或摘流量。\", \"inject_context\": \"⚠️ EXPIRED DATA — captured during fault injection (NOT current state)\\nThe observations below were made WHILE THE FAULT WAS ACTIVE. They represent the FAULT STATE, not the CURRENT (post-recovery) state.\\nYou MUST re-execute the same kubectl commands NOW to obtain CURRENT data. Using these injection-phase observations as 'current evidence' is INVALID.\\nFault effect confirmed with mechanism attribution. Executing Step 3 (user-pre-authorized early destroy).\\n\\n---\\n\\nRecovery failure detected — `blade_status` says **Destroyed** but a residual `chaos_os` (PID 4669) is still burning ~0.79 core. Consulting the documented failure mode and inspecting the residue.\\n\\n---\\n\\nResidual process carries a **different UID** (`cdb57e836d2eced5`) than my experiment (`c85164b57ff93a3a`). Gathering hard evidence before touching it.\\n\\n---\\n\\nDecisive evidence: the residual `chaos_os` (PID 4669) **started ~93 s ago — inside my injection window**, runs exactly `cpu fullload --cpu-count=1 --cpu-percent=80`, and measures 0.807 core. It is my injection's residue (documented \\\"destroy returns Success but stress process lingers\\\" mode), not a pre-existing orphan. Cleaning it up.\\n\\n---\\n\\nResidual process is gone and PID 1 (`./cart`) intact. The destroy CR `a6b53a74dbce5724` also completed and was garbage-collected — teardown was asynchronous, and my earlier probe caught it mid-flight. Verifying true normalization.\\n\\n---\\n\\nAll three approved mutation steps are issued and the target is fully recovered.\\n\\n## Execution Report\\n\\n**Step 1 — Injection (issued ✅)**\\n```\\nblade create k8s pod-cpu load --names cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w --namespace otel-demo \\\\\\n  --cpu-percent 80 --cpu-count 1 --timeout 600\\n→ code 200, success, EXPERIMENT UID = c85164b57ff93a3a\\n```\\nNote: the tool normalized `action=load` → `fullload` internally (`SubCommand: pod-cpu fullload`). Structured params `scope=pod, target=cpu, action=load` were used as give\\n\\n---\\n\\nLayer 1 reports the experiment **Destroyed**. Per instructions I must still perform Layer 2 to determine whether any residual effect remains. Taking a fresh, independent measurement now — same resource as baseline (cart container cgroup in `cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w`, which never restarted, so counters are continuous).\\n\\n---\\n\\nNo `chaos_os`/burn process present — only PID 1 `./cart`. Now measuring the current CPU rate over a 15 s window (planner's V2 interval) to compare against baseline.\\n\\n---\\n\\nCurrent CPU rate: (16430620629 − 16430513982) = **106,647 µs / 15 s = 0.0071 core (≈7m)** vs baseline **4m** — idle. No burn process, PSI 0.00, no ChaosBlade CRs, business logs normal. Attempting the skill case's Step-1 method for a same-method baseline comparison.\\n\\n---\\n\\nmetrics-server **is** working (contradicting the pre-task hint — trusting my observation): cart now **2m** vs baseline **4m**. One blast-radius signal needs clearing: `accounting` shows RESTARTS=190 (13m ago).\\n\\n---\\n\\nAll evidence gathered. `accounting`'s last OOMKill was at **09:00:43Z — 3 min 10 s BEFORE injection start (09:03:53Z)**, so chronologically not attributable; it's a chronic pre-existing loop (190 restarts). Node `tcse-v100-02`: 8 cores allocatable, Ready=True, no pressure conditions.\\n\\n**Negative Evidence enumeration** (each dismissed on fact or accepted):\\n1. *PSI stayed 0.00 during fault* → **dismissed**: `cpu.max = max 100000` (no limit), `nr_throttled=0`. PSI measures runqueue stall; a 0.8-cor\\n\\n---\\n\\n[finish_planning] Planning finalized. Summary: 对 otel-demo/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w 注入 [expired] 单核 CPU 负载（\\n\\n---\\n\\n[blade_create] {\\\"code\\\":200,\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":\\\"c85164b57ff93a3a\\\"}\\n\\n---\\n\\n[update_progress] progress recorded (facts=1, log=5)\\n\\n---\\n\\n[time_wait] Waited 30 seconds. Proceed with your next action.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[blade_query_k8s] {\\\"code\\\":200,\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"uid\\\":\\\"c85164b57ff93a3a\\\",\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"error\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"statuses\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6b5cc25994199661\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"Success\\\",\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"kind\\\":\\\"pod\\\",\\\"identifier\\\":\\\"otel-demo/tcse-\\n\\n---\\n\\n[kubectl] exec command output: output observed during injection (expired — re-execute now)\\n\\n---\\n\\n[kubectl] exec command output: output observed during injection (expired — re-execute now)\\n\\n---\\n\\n[update_progress] progress recorded (facts=3, log=8)\\n\\n---\\n\\n[blade_destroy] {\\\"code\\\":200,\\\"success\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"pod-cpu\\\",\\\"action\\\":\\\"fullload\\\",\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"cpu-count\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"cpu-percent\\\":\\\"80\\\",\\\"kubeconfig\\\":\\\"/root/bladeai-\", \"postmortem\": {\"path\": \"/root/bladeai-eval/cfg-qwen/postmortems/inject-d0fc193f-ff92-4e66-bd25-2cc29bae3359.md\", \"markdown\": \"## Summary\\n- **实验结果**：针对 `otel-demo/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w` 的 `pod-cpu-load` 注入成功产生约 80% 单核 CPU 负载，并在提前销毁后恢复到基线。\\n- **主要异常**：`blade_destroy` 返回成功后短暂残留 `chaos_os` 进程，最终由异步清理和手动 `kill` 收敛。\\n\\n## Background\\n- 用户请求：对 `otel-demo` 的 `cart` 服务注入 80% CPU 负载，最长 300 秒，验证故障效果和业务恢复。\\n- 故障类型：`pod-cpu-load`，目标动作 `load`，故障目标 `cpu`。\\n- 目标范围：`namespace=otel-demo`，单个 Pod `cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w`。\\n- 参数：`--cpu-percent 80`、`--cpu-count 1`、`--timeout 600`。\\n- 约束：平台最小 `--timeout` 为 600 秒；用户预授权在确认效果后立即销毁，不等待自动到期。\\n\\n## Timeline\\n- **16:45:30** 预检显示 `chaosblade_operator` 正常，`metrics-server` 被提示不可用。\\n- **16:45:36** 收到未验证故障意图，目标为 `otel-demo/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w`。\\n- **16:53:10** 计划确认，目标 Pod 健康，注入路径和验证方式完成核实。\\n- **17:03:52** `blade_create` 发起注入，参数为 `--cpu-percent 80 --cpu-count 1 --timeout 600`。\\n- **17:03:55** 注入返回成功，实验 UID 为 `c85164b57ff93a3a`。\\n- **17:04:22** 等待 30 秒，等待负载进入稳态。\\n- **17:05:04** `blade_query_k8s` 返回 `Success`，目标匹配唯一 Pod。\\n- **17:05:33** `cpu.stat usage_usec` 10 秒差值为 `7834970`，并发现 `chaos_os` PID `4631`。\\n- **17:06:37** 故障效果确认，按用户预授权发起 `blade_destroy`。\\n- **17:06:40** `blade_destroy` 返回成功。\\n- **17:06:56** `blade_status` 显示 `Destroyed`，但容器内仍发现残留 `chaos_os` PID `4669`。\\n- **17:07:10** 开始恢复失败排查，读取故障模式并检查残留进程。\\n- **17:08:22** 证据显示残留进程在注入窗口内启动，执行相同 `cpu fullload` 参数。\\n- **17:09:45** 手动清理残留进程，`chaosblade-tool` 正常，destroy CR 已不存在。\\n- **17:10:17** 恢复验证通过，CPU 使用率回到约 `0.0044 core`，无残留进程。\\n- **17:10:38** 执行完成，目标 Pod 保持 `1/1 Running` 且 `RESTARTS=0`。\\n- **17:11:55** Layer 1 判定 `warning`，原因是记录在超时前被销毁。\\n- **17:17:21** 提交最终验证，Layer 2 判定 `passed`。\\n\\n## Verifier Findings\\n- `verification.level` 为 `verified`。\\n- Layer 1 判定为 `warning`：实验记录在 `--timeout` 前被外部销毁，记录状态不能单独证明故障效果。\\n- Layer 2 判定为 `passed`：`cart` 容器 cgroup `cpu.stat usage_usec` 速率从约 `0.004 core` 升至 `0.783` 到 `0.807 core`，活跃窗口约 167 秒。\\n- 检查目标覆盖：`blade_query_k8s` 仅命中 `otel-demo/tcse-v100-02/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w/cart`，覆盖率为 `1/1`。\\n- 检查机制归因：容器内 `chaos_os` 进程命令行包含 `cpu fullload --cpu-count=1 --cpu-percent=80`。\\n- 检查恢复结果：销毁后最终无 `chaos_os`、`burn`、`stress` 残留进程，且集群内无 `chaosblades.chaosblade.io` CR。\\n- 安全评分：`blast_radius=30`、`frequency=20`、`time=80`、`topology=0`、`overall=24`，级别为 `low`。\\n- 检查项结果：CPU 上升检查通过，进程归因检查通过；APM 检查不适用，业务入口检查不适用。\\n\\n## Side Effects\\n- `pre_snapshot` 记录集群中有 `23` 个 Pod 和 `21` 个 Endpoint。\\n- 未观察到 Pod 驱逐、HPA 扩缩或 Endpoint 数量减少。\\n- `side_effects` 记录 `otel-demo/accounting-855dcc699b-l5g6h` 的 `accounting` 容器发生 `OOMKilled`。\\n- 该容器 `restart_delta=1`，`restart_count=191`，完成时间为 `2026-09-11T09:14:45Z`。\\n- 目标 Pod `cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w` 未发生容器重启，`RESTARTS=0`。\\n\\n## Root Cause Hypothesis\\n- 实验达到 `verified` 的直接原因是 `chaos_os` 在目标容器内执行 `cpu fullload --cpu-count=1 --cpu-percent=80`，产生约 0.78 到 0.81 核的稳定负载。\\n- Layer 1 为 `warning` 的原因是实验记录在 600 秒超时前被主动销毁；这是用户 300 秒上限与平台最小 600 秒冲突下的预期路径。\\n- 残留进程问题属于 `recovery_failure` 的异步清理竞态：`blade_destroy` 返回成功后，operator 仍在处理 destroy CR 和清理 burn 进程。\\n- `failure_detail` 未记录类别；实际观测到的异常未改变最终恢复结果，手动清理和异步清理均收敛。\\n- `cpu.pressure` 保持为 0 不是注入失败，因为目标 cgroup 的 `cpu.max` 无限制，PSI 不能作为该类负载的有效信号。\\n\\n## Recommendations\\n- 在 `blade_destroy` 后增加强制验证循环：执行 `kubectl exec -n otel-demo cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w -c cart -- sh -c 'for p in /proc/[0-9]*; do c=$(cat $p/comm); case $c in *chaos*|*burn*|*stress*) echo $p $c;; esac; done'`，并确认输出为空。\\n- 销毁后同时检查 CR 清理：执行 `kubectl get chaosblades.chaosblade.io -A`，确认无残留实验资源。\\n- 将 CPU 负载验证指标固定为 `cpu.stat usage_usec` 差值；不要将 `cpu.pressure` 用于无 CPU limit 的 cgroup。\\n- 独立修复 `accounting` 的慢性 OOM：执行 `kubectl describe pod accounting-855dcc699b-l5g6h -n otel-demo`，并提高 `resources.limits.memory` 或定位内存泄漏。\", \"summary\": \"- **实验结果**：针对 `otel-demo/cart-7c58f6bb56-zdp5w` 的 `pod-cpu-load` 注入成功产生约 80% 单核 CPU 负载，并在提前销毁后恢复到基线。 - **主要异常**：`blade_destroy` 返回成功后短暂残留 `chaos_os` 进程，最终由异步清理和手动 `kill` 收敛。\"}, \"issue_report\": null, \"error\": \"\", \"failure_reason\": \"\", \"failure_detail\": null, \"replan_count\": 0, \"verify_replan_count\": 0, \"replan_history\": [], \"side_effects_summary\": \"1 collateral impact(s) detected (ContainerRestarts: 1, EvictedPods: 0, OOMKill: 0, CrashLoop: 0, EndpointRemovals: 0, HPAScaling: 0, ProbeFailures: 0, DependencyErrors: 0)\"}}", "task_id": "turn-e708412252a4", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T17:20:26.688223+08:00"}

data: {"type": "done", "task_id": "turn-e708412252a4", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T17:20:26.688896+08:00"}

